{
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "哟哟哟，瞧瞧这是谁？新面孔啊？",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "打招呼",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_introduction",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "我只是路过而已。",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "是啊，当然。那可真是稀罕事儿。",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "又路过，嗯？拿一个去吧。算我请客。",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "不过话说回来，你能坚持到现在，还挺了不起的。\n换别人早该放弃了。",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "我还有什么选择吗？",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "你大可以转身走人啊。\n虽然会惹恼涅奥，但是……",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.next": "不同意",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_fear",
  "DARV.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-3.char": "只要这世界还在受苦，我就不会离开。",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "[sine]……有趣……\n……一位新的……访客……？[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "介绍自己",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_curious",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "我来此地，是为找到此地的主人。\n并终结他的疯狂。",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "[sine]……很好……我……期待着……\n……与你……共事……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_sleepy",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……只要 [red]他[/red] 还活着……\n……就永无宁日……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_welcome",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.char": "又回来了，再一次……\n看来我们的约定还要继续。",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.ancient": "[sine]……你会……继续战斗……\n……直到……一切……尘埃落定……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_sleepy",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "来者何人？我不记得叫过护卫啊",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "走上前",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_eeked",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "你的守卫让我进来的。我只说了几句话而已。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "那想必是非常动听的话了。\n进来吧，鸦鸦。你勾起了我的兴趣。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "刀剑、魔法，还有为战争附魔的利刃……\n它们各有各的用处。但你我都清楚，我们最强大的武器是魅力。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "作为一只普通的渡鸦，你倒是仪态万方。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "感到不满",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_giggle",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "我就当是赞美了。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "对我来说，漂亮鸟儿？当然是赞美。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_giggle",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.ancient": "你确定我不能说服你效忠一位新女主人吗？\n涅奥浪费了你的才能，让你一次次撞向高墙，指望它能自己碎掉。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_giggle",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.next": "拒绝",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1.char": "感谢你的好意。但如果我要争取我所奋斗的未来，我需要她的力量。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-2.ancient": "真可惜。不过如果你改变主意，我的提议依然有效。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_grossed_out",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "鸟！！傀儡鸟！为什么是傀儡？为什么是鸟！？",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "回答",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "我只是生来如此。",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.char": "……而且我是独立的个体。\n不管别人怎么说。",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-3.ancient": "哇！！说得真好！你明明在撒谎，我却信了！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "不是傀儡的傀儡！！给你亮闪闪！鸟喜欢亮闪闪！",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "鸟傀儡！别打建筑师！打架不好！",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "解释",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "一个疯狂的国王威胁着人民所建立的一切。\n我怎能袖手旁观？",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "威胁不好！打架更糟！暴力的循环！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-3.char": "任由铁靴踩在脸上，是无法逃离这个循环的。",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.char": "恕我直言……你在融化。",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.ancient": "[思虑]我是在融化。让你困扰了吗……？[/思虑]",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "否认",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.char": "我担心这困扰的是[b]你[/b]。\n更担心的是，你竟然毫不在意。",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-3.ancient": "[思虑]我为何要在意？\n我沉睡着，且心满意足……[/思虑]",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "[思虑]你不会接受事物本来的样子。\n但我仍会尽力给你一些慰藉……[/思虑]",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "[思虑]你为何要做这徒劳的挣扎……？[/思虑]",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "告诉他",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "如果我相信自己无法改变任何事，那就会变成真的。",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "[思虑]如此渺小，却又如此渴望有所作为。\n拿上你想要的，然后让我安眠吧……[/思虑]",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "又是匕首！！我的失望无穷无尽！！！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "安慰",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "当我的力量不足时，我会借助巫术之力。",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "魔法就是力量？？让我看看！！！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_curiosity",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "武器！拿上武器！下次用剑魔法！！！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "来跟我打，女巫！！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "战斗",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "……！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "装死",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "已经死了！我还以为你更强呢！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.next": "撒谎",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-3.char": "确实。没有一位强大战士的帮助，我毫无胜算。",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-3.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-4.ancient": "说得对！拿上这个！！！",
  "TANX.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-4.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_laugh",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.char": "至少能找到个暖和的地方，还挺不错的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.ancient": "哦，我只能[jitter][b]想象[/b][/jitter]一下。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "吓一跳",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.char": "啊，抱歉。我不是有意打扰。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-3.ancient": "一点也不，一点也不！快进来，别客气。\n我一直很欢迎[jitter][b]志同道合之人[/b][/jitter]。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "我最近见过许多迷人的火焰，但只有一簇与[b]你[/b]的相似。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "其他人不会说，但我得谢谢你手下留情，亲爱的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "询问",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "你什么意思？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "如果按你的性子来，你早把我们全砍倒了！\n仅仅因为你[jitter][b]不能[/b][/jitter]，并不意味着我不感激你还没试过。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.ancient": "你知道的，一位母亲最大的快乐，就是看着她的孩子们长大。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.next": "上钩",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1.char": "我有点担心你是怎么看待我们之间的关系的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-2.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]特兹卡塔拉的笑声如熔炉般隆隆作响。[/font_size][/i]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-2.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-3.ancient": "哦，亲爱的，我不是指[jitter][b]那个[/b][/jitter]。\n总有一天你会明白的。明白你[sine]错过了[/sine]什么。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.char": "建筑师！这种疯狂必须终结！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.ancient": "我同意。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "质疑",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.char": "不知怎的，我觉得你并非真心。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0.ancient": "看来我是被烦人的乌鸦缠上了。真不幸，我得再杀你一次。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0.next": "反抗",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-1.char": "死亡吓不到我。你也一样。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-2.char": "在邪恶面前，我绝不会退缩。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-2.next": "战斗",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-3.ancient": "试试看啊，鸟儿。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0r.char": "再杀我一次！你阻挡不了我的决心！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1r.ancient": "可惜。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0r.ancient": "你为何执意要进行这场无谓的战斗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0r.next" : "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1r.char": "因为这世界可以变得更好。即便要倒下千次，只要有一次能换来那样的未来，我也在所不惜。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-2r.ancient": "不会的。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.4-0r.char": "如果需要的话，我会用我自己的血爪，把你建造的一切都撕碎。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.4-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.4-1r.ancient": "它们可以变得更血腥。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.4-attack": "Both",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "看看你，大明星。不如在这儿签个字，我们好给你弄点真正的[sine]力量[/sine]？",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "拒绝",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "我看起来像傻子吗？",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "怎么，想要我强买强卖？行！第一次[jitter][b]免费[/b][/jitter]。",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "哟，这不是我最爱的火把妹吗！\n说反话呢。挑一个然后滚蛋。",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "可惜你不肯跟我合作。你会成为一个出色的[sine]暴君[/sine]。",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "嗤之以鼻",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "没有神明，也没有主人。\n为了所有人，不止是我。",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "是啊，你真是人民的好鸟儿。但我见过你心里的那团火。",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-3.ancient": "那在你灵魂余烬中噼啪作响的微小声音……它歌颂的可不是[sine]解放[/sine]。",

  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "来吧，姐妹，幸会。这个十字路口容得下另一位修行者。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "接受",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "感谢你的盛情。但我不知道我们修习的是否是同一门技艺。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "在魔法的领域，并非如此。你身上携带的火花，是凡人之躯所拥有的[i]亵渎[/i]之物。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-3.ancient": "但就我们共享的其他技艺而言，我很乐意为你提供庇护。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "姐妹会中自有你的位置。别忘了。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "我注意到你经常路过。别灰心。这任务本就不是一击能成的。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "回应",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "那我就用无数次攻击来完成它。屈服可不是什么值得的结局。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.char": "你知道吗，尽管我嘴上厉害……我还真有点怀念过去，把匕首插进敌人心脏他们就死了的日子。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-0.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HECATE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.3-1.ancient": "啊，凡人。我忘了你们对这种事毫无准备。嗯，也许在魔法力有不逮时，一点巫术会有所帮助。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "哦，天哪。我得说，这不是我通常的风格，但你确实仪态不凡，亲爱的渡鸦。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "不否认",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "我领受这份赞美。要营造出一种毫不费力的美感，付出的努力比任何人想象的都要多。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "谁说不是呢？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "很高兴再次见到你，我漂亮的鸟儿。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "我无法否认，低调的风格很适合你。\n但在某些地方多点缀一点[i]羽饰[/i]，或许能让你的敌人多迟缓那么一小会儿。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "怀疑",
  "HADESANCIENTS-APHRODITE_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "感谢你的信任。但恐怕这座塔里，能引起我兴趣的东西屈指可数。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "真是怪异的时代，我们竟要依赖凡人的帮助。你最好别浪费我的恩赐。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "反驳",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "只有我们凡人会把性命押上。没有我们的鲜血和劳作，你又算什么女神呢？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "你是一头无礼的野兽。但愿这意味着你也是一头高效的野兽。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "尽管我不愿承认……但我很感激你在我们斗争中的付出。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "不以为意",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ATHENA_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "神或凡人，我们目标一致。你不求更多，我也不求。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "少见这么迷人的鹰身女妖！来，喝一杯，这至少是我能做的！",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "只抿一口",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "我有个原则，要做房间里最清醒的人。所以我想我还是可以放纵一下的。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "少见这么迷人的鹰身女妖！来，一起——哦。有事要忙，陌生人？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.char": "……",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "别去看它",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.ancient": "啊……你好？我们认识吗？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "别",
  "HADESANCIENTS-DIONYSUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.char": "也许你不记得才是最好的。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "他们就让你带着这种小黄油刀上阵？那还杀个屁的建筑师啊。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "为你的工具辩护",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "这些年它们一直用得很顺手。而且我已经用得相当习惯了。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "[i]呃[/i]，好像我没听过[i]这种话[/i]似的。行吧，好吧。我至少帮你把它们磨利了。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "好吧，[i]女巫[/i]。我知道你不可能全靠魔法赢，所以让我给你武装一下。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "我想我得承认，那些刀剑比乍一看更有门道。至少，承载着历史。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "同意",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "历史，是的。而且没什么值得骄傲的。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-HEPHAESTUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "[i]啧……[/i]它们是战刀，姐妹。要是没沾过血，那才叫没用。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "幸会，战士！想不到我会和天空中的生物并肩作战，但战争总会带来奇怪的盟友，不是吗？让我看看能为你这样的存在准备些什么，嗯？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "眨眼",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "（我甚至插不上话……我绝不能小看神明。）",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "又见面了！我会速战速决，然后送你上路。我可不想让你的羽毛浸透水，对吧？哈哈！",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.char": "你知道吗，我们鸦科其实是不会飞的？而且渡鸦在水边也不是什么稀罕景。它们很聪明，会抓鱼什么的。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.ancient": "所以你的族人掠夺我的领域？如果你想赢得我的青睐，这可不是个好说法。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "收回前言",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.char": "一只鸟是[i]我的族人[/i]，这说法不比说猿猴是人类的族人更靠谱。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-POSEIDON_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-3.ancient": "哈！你当真了，对吧？放轻松，我的鸟朋友！来，让我送你个礼物，就当为我的小玩笑赔罪了。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "向你致敬，亲爱的女士。我一直在观察你为我们的伟业英勇奋战，我向你坦白，我的心被触动了。请允许我赐予你我最卓越的恩赐，以回报你的努力。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "接受",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "感谢你的慷慨馈赠。我相信我能为我的匕首附上闪电，大有用处。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "啊——当然。我那雷霆万钧之力的恩赐。是的，确实是个好选择。我相信它会对你有大用。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "又见面了，我美丽的女巫！你需要我的祝福来度过这些难关，我很荣幸能赐予你。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "我不想显得失礼，我美丽的渡鸦。但我费了不少功夫才为你提供这些恩赐，恐怕有时我的示好没有得到回应。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "招架",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "听你这么说，真让人遗憾，万神之神。你跟你的妻子聊过这些感受吗？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ZEUS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "哎呀，别这么说，我何必拿这些琐事去烦赫拉——我亲爱的、甜蜜的赫拉，我艰难时刻的磐石。\n不，事实上，我看她完全没必要知道这些。你同意吗？毕竟你还有任务在身。让我赐予你我的恩赐，然后送你上路吧。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "又一个老练的杀手，我们这儿也不是头一个了。这就是我喜欢凡人的地方。你们对热血沸腾的理解，远超我的那些亲族。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "反驳",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "所以我们中大多数人都尽量避免流血，只要有可能的话。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "就算我不是战神，也知道那[i]不是[/i]真的。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "别那么不愿让你的刀刃染血，女巫。在我的帮助下，你会让我们的敌人[b]流血[/b]。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "你以为你比在战场上时更好了。但你仍然在为我的事业而杀戮，小渡鸦。\n这就是你们凡人的本性。为何不坦然接受呢？",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "鄙夷",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "我不是那种为出价最高者卖命的嗜血蛮子。而且，仅仅因为我们的目标一致，并不意味着我是为你而战。",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "继续",
  "HADESANCIENTS-ARES_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.ancient": "但你的确在战斗，我亲爱的凡人。而那意味着，你就是在为[b]我[/b]而战。",

  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "我知道你是什么东西，你胸腔里燃烧着那团虚无之火。\n给你点机会，你就会毁灭这个世界。",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "否认",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "也许是你的世界。但[i]这个[/i]世界属于它的人民。只要我还有一丝尚存，我就会为他们重建家园的权利而战。",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "你觉得你的意志比你体内那东西更强？我几乎觉得有点好笑了。\n行吧，虚空之子。去证明我是错的吧。",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "用毁灭性的工具来武装你，感觉不太明智。\n但我作为一个慷慨的主人，总不能让你空手而归。",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "你还没能让现实在我们眼前崩塌。\n我该把这视为一种福气。",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "耍嘴皮子",
  "SARAKTTHECUBE-SARAKT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.char": "我敢肯定，我很快就会抽空去做的。",

  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.ancient": "现在连害虫都带着羽毛闯入我的领地了。你们这些家伙真是越来越恶心了。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.next": "嗤笑",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.char": "我虽无力因你的话语而击倒你。但你也缺乏伤害我自尊的底气。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2r.ancient": "[b]哼。[/b]拿上你的财宝吧，看看你的“底气”能带你走多远。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.char": "这次不用叫我害虫了。我办完事就走。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-1r.ancient": "你以为扭动得有效率些，就能让你变成高贵的蠕虫了？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-1r.next": "直言不讳",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-2r.char": "我想，你独自一人已经很久了。紧抓着那顽固的优越感不放，以此作为对抗这空虚世界绝望的最后一道壁垒。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-3r.char": "而我最不需要做的，就是把时间花在思考你悲惨的命运上。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-4r.ancient": "[jitter][b]……滚。[/b][/jitter]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.ancient":"进来吧，疲惫的旅人。有兴趣来局牌吗？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.next": "接受",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.char": "我想我可以玩一局。反正也不急着登顶。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2r.ancient": "太好了，太好了。但别把牌往袖子里藏，小滑头。我不会警告第二遍。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.ancient": "今天有人杀气腾腾啊。需要什么锋利又尖锐的东西吗，杀手？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.next": "讨价还价",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.char": "我的魅力可不仅仅始于刀尖，也终于刀尖。\n……不过如果你有刀，我也不介意收下。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2r.ancient": "哦，我当然[i]有[/i]。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.char": "[i][font_size=22]女巫环顾四周，当即决定不想跟这一切扯上任何关系。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0r.next": "我想顺点东西",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]但她还是顺手拿了点小东西离开。总比落在他们手里强。[/font_size][/i]",

  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "一只鸟。会用火魔法。还戴顶小帽子。\n……",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.ancient": "不，不，你太精明了。我眯着眼也看不出来。",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "结束对话",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.char": "我不知道你在说什么。",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "好吧。给大胆的魔法师一份祝福。",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.ancient": "你很聪明，小滑头。但你很脆弱。如果你走得太深，你那中空的骨头会在压力下折断。",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-0.next": "继续",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.ancient": "你确信你的事业值得如此付出吗？",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-1.next": "肯定",
  "NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT-NINOMAE_INA_NIS_ANCIENT.talk.THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.2-2.char": "如果我仍在为自己而战，面对这不可能之事，我的自尊也会屈服。\n但我是在为未来而战。现在驱动我的东西，比单纯的自我要强大得多。",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "怎么，你觉得自己太优秀了，不愿跟我做交易，却跑去碰[jitter]那[/jitter]玩意儿？",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "回避",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "你怨恨我不让你控制我。那本书同样也控制不了我。",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "你觉得只要说得够坚定，就会变成真的。到目前为止这对你都挺管用的，对吧？\n但这世上有比魔法更强大的力量，姑娘。你不会想用惨痛代价来明白这一点的。",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "可怜又愚蠢的小鸟。你以为自己聪明到不会与魔鬼做交易。可你看看现在的你。",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "故作勇敢",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "为了走到这一步，我做了我必须做的事。为了走得更远，我也会做我必须做的事。无论面对什么挑战，我都会找到取胜之道。",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "你会[b]陨落[/b]的，女巫。坠入你甚至无法[jitter][b]想象[/b][/jitter]的深渊。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "亲爱的……求你告诉我你没碰那东西。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "安抚",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_eeked",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "没什么好担心的。我清楚那本书的条款……不太妙。\n但我不按那本书的条款行事。我按我自己的来。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "我真心希望你是对的。为了我们大家，就算不是为了你自己。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_grossed_out",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "我漂亮的小鸟儿……你都干了些什么？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "虚张声势",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_grossed_out",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "没什么是我不能用口才再混过去的。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "哦，亲爱的……这次不行了。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_grossed_out",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "女巫！！邪恶的书！别看！！！",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "沉思",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "说实话，我不确定施法是否真的需要去读它。",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "当然不用！！读书是书呆子才干的事！！！",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_laugh",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient": "鸟女士！前面有个强敌等着！！它会杀了你！！！",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.next": "试探出路",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.char": "强大到足以让传说中的坦克斯也感兴趣的敌人……？",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient": "操！不！你当我傻吗？？？",
  "TANX.talk.NECRONOMICON_MAXED_THESORCERESSMOD-THE_SORCERESS_MOD.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_laugh"
}